/span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">군입대</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; *</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">인정서류&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">기관에서 발급한 증빙서류&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">입원확인서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">취업확인서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">입영통지서</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">현장실습 신청자는 최종 합격확인서 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">반드시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">지참</span></strong></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"pad