-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">개인별 부여된 가상계좌번호로 수강료 납부 또는 입금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">인터넷뱅킹</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">폰뱅킹 등 이용 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">송금시 받는 사람 이름</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">학생 본인이름</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">필히 확인</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">송금시 보내는 사람은 학생이름이 아니라도 상관없음</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">보호자 통장으로 이체 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">가상계좌번호는 매학기 마다 변경될 수 있음</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">본인 원스톱서비스에서 가상계좌확인 후 납부</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt; background-color: rgb(0, 153, 153);\">해당 납부 기간 내 반드시 납부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt; background-color: rgb(0, 153, 153);\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 13pt; background-color: rgb(0, 153, 153);\">은행마감시간 참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-